@@ -7,3 +7,3 @@
 # A free audit of how your business shows up in local search 
-Tell us about your business and three competitors. We compare your Google Business Profile and website with theirs for the searches you care about, and email you a written report. 
+Tell us about your business and up to three competitors. We compare your Google Business Profile, if you have one, and your website with theirs for the searches you care about, and email you a written report. 
 Request the audit   
@@ -11,6 +11,6 @@
 ## What the audit covers  
-- Your Google Business Profile: categories, attributes, services, description, photos and posts, set against what your competitors do. 
-- Your reviews: how many you have, how often new ones come in, what customers mention, and how your competitors' reviews differ. 
-- Your website: whether your main service pages match the searches you named, and which local topics your competitors cover that you don't. 
-- Your business details: whether your name, address and phone number match across the web.  
+- Your Google Business Profile: categories, attributes, services, description, photos and posts, set against what your competitors do. If you don't have a profile yet, the report starts with how to set one up. 
+- Your Google reviews, if you have a profile: how many you have, how often new ones come in, what customers mention, and how your competitors' reviews differ. 
+- Your website: whether your main service pages match the searches you named, and which topics your competitors cover that you don't. 
+- Your business details: whether your name, address and phone number match across the web. For online-only businesses, we check your profiles on directories, social sites and marketplaces instead.  
 Each finding comes with a suggested fix and a note on how much it's likely to matter.   
