@@ -175,3 +210,3 @@
 Who is responsible. Finansium AB is the data controller for Query Polish. Contact: henrik.ekenberg@finansium.se. 
-What we collect. What you type into the audit form: details about your business, your services and market, the searches you want to show up for, three competitors, any numbers you choose to share, and your email address. We never ask for passwords or logins. 
+What we collect. What you type into the audit form: how your customers find your business, details about your business, your services and market, the searches you want to show up for, up to three competitors, any numbers you choose to share, your email address and the language you want the report in. We never ask for passwords or logins. 
 Why. Only to prepare your audit and email the report to you. The legal basis is your consent, which you give by ticking the box on the form. We don't sell your information, share it for marketing, or add you to a mailing list. 
